                    <span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success small">Sep 2024</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Description -->
                <p class="card-text text-muted small mb-3">
                    Designed and configured a small office network using Cisco Packet Tracer.
                    Implemented VLAN segmentation, inter-VLAN routing, and access control lists
                    (ACLs) to secure network traffic between departments.
                </p>
                
                <!-- Skills Tags -->
